ind":"announcement","title":"The Merchant Miles Demo Is Live!","summary":"The free Merchant Miles demo is now available on Steam! 🎉You can finally set out as a travelling merchant, read the market, buy your first stock and see whether your trading instincts actually pay off.In the demo, you can:Travel between towns with different prices and demandRead news, rumours and market informationBuy goods with limited coins and cargo spaceRun your own market stallSet prices and haggle with customersTake on contracts and build your reputationDeal with changing markets, rival me","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-05T21:26:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656394671","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:50:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3688500-1840944183786683","game_id":"steam-3688500","kind":"announcement","title":"Why I'm making Merchant Miles","summary":"Merchant Miles is now on Steam!I’ve always loved trading games: the feeling of spotting an opportunity, taking a risk on a new product, and gradually learning what works. But I wanted to make one that feels a little more personal. Less like staring at spreadsheets and more like running a small stall on the road.In Merchant Miles, you’ll buy goods, decide what can fit in your barrels, travel between towns, set up for the day, and see what people actually want. Some things will sell immediately. S","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-17T17:01:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183786683","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:50:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3688500":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:44:15Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T00:44:15Z","error_codes":